\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.7}{\ignorespaces Empirical sampled stabilization regions of the SDP-MPC controller with $u_{\max }=15\,\mathrm {N\,m}$. The tuples $(\Delta t_{\mathrm {SDP}},\Delta t_{\mathrm {sim}}, \Delta t_{\mathrm {ctrl}})$ are $(0.1,0.1,0.1)\,\mathrm {s}$ in Case~I, $(0.05,0.05,0.05)\,\mathrm {s}$ in Case~II, and $(0.1,0.0025,0.025)\,\mathrm {s}$ in Case~III. Cases~I and II use matched time scales, whereas Case~III uses a prediction model with a finer simulation time steps and control update.}}{94}{figure.caption.84}%
